           "defName": "RM_KeelHoist",
           "label": "keel hoist",
           "description": "A ship's winch, cable and cradle. Drop the cable onto a cave mouth or dungeon entrance, or onto a ledge nobody can walk to; then load it like any portal. Cargo rides the cable for a while before it arrives, heavier loads longer. Downed strangers arrive as prisoners and downed wild beasts arrive bound. Raise the cradle to bring up what waits below. The ship cannot launch while the cable is down.\n\n<i><color=#66E0E4FF>RimMandrake: Keel Hoist</color></i>",
